<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Confirme os documentos | Memorium</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/IMGS/gallery/favicon.ico">
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 24px 16px; background: #f5f1fa; color: #292436; font: 16px/1.6 Arial, sans-serif; }
    main { width: min(100%, 560px); padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #27103a18; }
    h1 { margin-top: 0; color: #59249b; }
    a { color: #59249b; }
    .field { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; margin: 18px 0; }
    .field input { margin-top: 5px; }
    .error { padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: #fff0f0; color: #9c2525; }
    button { width: 100%; padding: 12px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: linear-gradient(105deg, #8250ed, #be47dc); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .logout { display: block; margin-top: 16px; text-align: center; }
    .legal-dialog { position: fixed; inset: 0; width: min(920px, calc(100vw - 32px)); max-height: 82vh; margin: auto; padding: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 16px; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px #27103a55; }
    .legal-dialog::backdrop { background: rgba(41, 36, 54, 0.72); }
    .legal-dialog-header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; min-height: 52px; padding: 8px 12px 8px 18px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd4e7; }
    .legal-dialog-header h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
    .legal-dialog-close { width: 36px; height: 36px; margin: 0; border: 0; border-radius: 50%; background: transparent; color: #292436; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1; }
    .legal-dialog iframe { display: block; width: 100%; height: min(70vh, 700px); border: 0; border-radius: 0 0 16px 16px; background: #fff; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>Leia e confirme os documentos</h1>
    <p>Para continuar usando sua conta, é necessário aceitar a versão vigente dos Termos de Uso e confirmar a leitura do Aviso de Privacidade.</p>
    <p>Termos versão <%= termosVersao %> · Aviso de Privacidade versão <%= privacidadeVersao %></p>
    <% if (mensagem) { %>
      <p class="error" role="alert"><%= mensagem %></p>
    <% } %>
    <form method="post" action="/usuario/aceitar-documentos">
      <label class="field">
        <input type="checkbox" name="aceitaTermos" required>
        <span>Li e aceito os <a href="/termos" class="legal-popup" data-legal-title="Termos de Uso">Termos de Uso</a>.</span>
      </label>
      <label class="field">
        <input type="checkbox" name="leuPrivacidade" required>
        <span>Li o <a href="/privacidade" class="legal-popup" data-legal-title="Aviso de Privacidade">Aviso de Privacidade</a>.</span>
      </label>
      <button type="submit">Confirmar e continuar</button>
    </form>
    <form method="post" action="/usuario/deslogar">
      <button class="logout" type="submit">Sair da conta</button>
    </form>
  </main>
  <dialog class="legal-dialog" id="legalDialog" aria-labelledby="legalDialogTitle">
    <div class="legal-dialog-header">
      <h2 id="legalDialogTitle">Documento</h2>
      <button type="button" class="legal-dialog-close" aria-label="Fechar">&times;</button>
    </div>
    <iframe title="Documento legal" src="about:blank"></iframe>
  </dialog>
  <script>
    (() => {
      const dialog = document.getElementById('legalDialog');
      const iframe = dialog.querySelector('iframe');
      const title = document.getElementById('legalDialogTitle');
      const closeButton = dialog.querySelector('.legal-dialog-close');

      document.querySelectorAll('.legal-popup').forEach((link) => {
        link.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          title.textContent = link.dataset.legalTitle;
          iframe.title = link.dataset.legalTitle;
          iframe.src = link.href;
          if (typeof dialog.showModal === 'function') dialog.showModal();
          else window.open(link.href, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer');
        });
      });

      closeButton.addEventListener('click', () => dialog.close());
      dialog.addEventListener('click', (event) => {
        if (event.target === dialog) dialog.close();
      });
      dialog.addEventListener('close', () => {
        iframe.src = 'about:blank';
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
